      "traditional": "山東的大明湖有一個非常嚴重的問題，每天有50公斤的魚死亡。",
      "pinyin": "shān dōng de dà míng hú yǒu yí ge fēi cháng yán zhòng de wèn tí měi tiān yǒu 2 gōng jīn de yú sǐ wáng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "原因是放生。",
      "traditional": "原因是放生。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yīn shì fàng shēng",
      "english": "Shandong’s Daming lake has a big problem, every day there are 50 kilograms of dead fish."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "那么，什么叫放生呢？",
      "traditional": "那麼，什麼叫放生呢？",
      "pinyin": "nà me shén me jiào fàng shēng ne",
      "english": "The reason is fangsheng."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "放生是信佛教的人喜欢做的一件事。",
      "traditional": "放生是信佛教的人喜歡做的一件事。",
      "pinyin": "fàng shēng shì xìn fó jiào de rén xǐ huan zuò de yí jiàn shì",
      "english": "Then, what is fangsheng?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "他们想给动物自由，所以把它们放回到大自然里面。",
      "traditional": "他們想給動物自由，所以把它們放回到大自然裡面。",
      "pinyin": "tā men xiǎng gěi dòng wù zì yóu suǒ yǐ bǎ tā men fàng huí dào dà zì rán lǐ miàn",
      "english": "Fangsheng is something people who believe in Buddhism like to do."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "放生的人觉得这对他们自己的生活来说也有帮助。",
      "traditional": "放生的人覺得這對他們自己的生活來說也有幫助。",
      "pinyin": "fàng shēng de rén jué de zhè duì tā men zì jǐ de shēng huó lái shuō yě yǒu bāng zhù",
      "english": "They want to give animals freedom, so they put them back into the wild."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "但是有一个问题，很多放回到大明湖里的鱼其实不能在大明湖里活下去，很快就死了。",
      "traditional": "但是有一個問題，很多放回到大明湖裡的魚其實不能在大明湖裡活下去，很快就死了。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì yǒu yí ge wèn tí hěn duō fàng huí dào dà míng hú lǐ de yú qí shí bù néng zài dà míng hú lǐ huó xià qù hěn kuài jiù sǐ le",
      "english": "People who do fangsheng think this will benefit their own lives too."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "所以很多人批评放生的人，",
      "traditional": "所以很多人批評放生的人，",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ hěn duō rén pī píng fàng shēng de rén",
      "english": "But there is a problem, a lot of fish put into Daming lake actually cannot live in Daming lake, and die very quickly."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "说为了自己心里好受让鱼死了，并不是一个信佛教的人应该做的。",
