      "pinyin": "shuō wèi le zì jǐ xīn li hǎo shòu ràng yú sǐ le bìng bú shì yí ge xìn fó jiào de rén yīng gāi zuò de",
      "english": "So a lot of people criticize people who do fangsheng, .."
    }
