    "sentence_translations": [
      "What killed all the fish?",
      "",
      "Shandong’s Daming lake has a big problem, every day there are 50 kilograms of dead fish.",
      "The reason is fangsheng.",
      "Then, what is fangsheng?",
      "Fangsheng is something people who believe in Buddhism like to do.",
      "They want to give animals freedom, so they put them back into the wild.",
      "People who do fangsheng think this will benefit their own lives too.",
      "But there is a problem, a lot of fish put into Daming lake actually cannot live in Daming lake, and die very quickly.",
      "So a lot of people criticize people who do fangsheng, ..",
      ".. and say that letting fish die for their own lives isn’t at all something people who believe in Buddhism should do."
    ]
